(7696859, 1262407, 135629, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot deserving of good scores, especially appreciate the dof, and shutter speed allowing for showing movement in the tires, adds to the action. The only thing that sticks out at me with this one is the area around the eyes in the goggles seems a little over corrected for the shadowing and natural light. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Nice clean shot deserving of good scores, especially appreciate the dof, and shutter speed allowing for showing movement in the tires, adds to the action. The only thing that sticks out at me with this one is the area around the eyes in the goggles seems a little over corrected for the shadowing and natural light. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2021-06-30 10:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
